<div class="m__pslider__swiper-wrapper">
<div class="m__pslider__swiper swiper">
<div class="swiper-wrapper">
<div class="m__pslider__swiper-slide swiper-slide">
<div class="flex-xl-row-reverse row">
<div class="col-12 col-xl-6 m__pslider__swiper-slide-right">
<div class="m__pslider__swiper-slide-highlight u__img-cover"><img src="img/taipei.jpg" /></div>

<div class="m__pslider__swiper-slide-card">
<p class="f__headline-h2 m__pslider__swiper-slide-card-title u__c-green">台北</p>
<div class="m__pslider__swiper-slide-card-divider"></div>

<p class="f__paragraph-regular m__pslider__swiper-slide-excerpt u__c-brown">亞洲第一間分店，位於微風南山47樓，台北101與信義區美景盡收眼底。除了賓至如歸的服務，頂級的酒藏飲品與夜間酒吧的live band表演，都將帶給你最難忘的體驗。</p>
<a class="button " href="zh_TW/menu/taipei" target=""><span>瀏覽菜單</span></a></div>
</div>

<div class="col-12 col-xl-6 col-xxl-5 d-none d-xl-block m__pslider__swiper-slide-left">
<p class="f__poster m__pslider__swiper-slide-title u__c-green |">台北</p>
<div class="m__pslider__swiper-slide-divider"></div>

<p class="f__paragraph-large m__pslider__swiper-slide-large-text u__c-brown">台北市信義區松智路17號47樓<br />
(微風南山)<br />
(02)2345-5647</p>
</div>
<div class="col-1 d-none d-xxl-block"></div></div>
</div>

<div class="m__pslider__swiper-slide swiper-slide">
<div class="flex-xl-row-reverse row">
<div class="col-12 col-xl-6 m__pslider__swiper-slide-right">
<div class="m__pslider__swiper-slide-highlight u__img-cover"><img src="img/taichung.jpg" /></div>

<div class="m__pslider__swiper-slide-card">
<p class="f__headline-h2 m__pslider__swiper-slide-card-title u__c-green">台中</p>
<div class="m__pslider__swiper-slide-card-divider"></div>

<p class="f__paragraph-regular m__pslider__swiper-slide-excerpt u__c-brown">位於七期，經典綠色搭配木質調營造出優雅舒適氛圍，五間包廂提供不同用餐需求。戶外用餐區壯闊景觀令人讚嘆，爵士樂團演奏與專業侍酒服務打造獨一無二的用餐體驗。</p>
<a class="button " href="zh_TW/menu/taichung" target=""><span>瀏覽菜單</span></a></div>
</div>

<div class="col-12 col-xl-6 col-xxl-5 d-none d-xl-block m__pslider__swiper-slide-left">
<p class="f__poster m__pslider__swiper-slide-title u__c-green |">台中</p>
<div class="m__pslider__swiper-slide-divider"></div>

<p class="f__paragraph-large m__pslider__swiper-slide-large-text u__c-brown">台中市西屯區朝富路213號34樓<br />
(CBD時代廣場)<br />
(04)2252-5647</p>
</div>
<div class="col-1 d-none d-xxl-block"></div></div>
</div>

<div class="m__pslider__swiper-slide swiper-slide">
<div class="flex-xl-row-reverse row">
<div class="col-12 col-xl-6 m__pslider__swiper-slide-right">
<div class="m__pslider__swiper-slide-highlight u__img-cover"><img src="img/manila_cover.jpg" /></div>

<div class="m__pslider__swiper-slide-card">
<p class="f__headline-h2 m__pslider__swiper-slide-card-title u__c-green">馬尼拉</p>
<div class="m__pslider__swiper-slide-card-divider"></div>

<p class="f__paragraph-regular m__pslider__swiper-slide-excerpt u__c-brown">位於BGC 精華特區頂級地標「金融中心大樓」，結合了頂級牛排館與優雅的小酒館空間，提供尊榮的餐飲體驗與專屬包廂，是高階商務會議與重要慶典的絕佳首選；The Grill and Lounge 則營造出微醺放鬆的精緻氛圍，週末夜間現場音樂演出，適合愜意的小聚</p>
<a class="button " href="https://smithandwollensky.com.ph/" target="_blank"><span>瀏覽網站</span></a></div>
</div>

<div class="col-12 col-xl-6 col-xxl-5 d-none d-xl-block m__pslider__swiper-slide-left">
<p class="f__poster m__pslider__swiper-slide-title u__c-green |">菲律賓</p>
<div class="m__pslider__swiper-slide-divider"></div>

<p class="f__paragraph-large m__pslider__swiper-slide-large-text u__c-brown">第26街與第9大道交叉口，金融中心大樓2樓<br />
(馬尼拉 BGC 特區)<br />
+632 8248 9470</p>
</div>
<div class="col-1 d-none d-xxl-block"></div></div>
</div>

<div class="m__pslider__swiper-slide swiper-slide">
<div class="flex-xl-row-reverse row">
<div class="col-12 col-xl-6 m__pslider__swiper-slide-right">
<div class="m__pslider__swiper-slide-highlight u__img-cover"><img src="img/tokyo_cover.jpg" /></div>

<div class="m__pslider__swiper-slide-card">
<p class="f__headline-h2 m__pslider__swiper-slide-card-title u__c-green">東京</p>
<div class="m__pslider__swiper-slide-card-divider"></div>

<p class="f__paragraph-regular m__pslider__swiper-slide-excerpt u__c-brown">進駐東京時尚核心「銀座五丁目」，日本首間分店坐落於頂樓 12 樓。承襲美式經典的頂級乾式熟成牛排工藝，店內不僅設有專屬的頂級酒窖，收藏超過 2,000 瓶精選佳釀，酒吧更引進精彩的現場樂團演奏，在銀座高空為您交織出兼具視覺、聽覺與味覺的頂級優雅奢華饗宴。</p>
<a class="button " href="https://www.smithandwollensky.jp/" target="_blank"><span>瀏覽網站</span></a></div>
</div>

<div class="col-12 col-xl-6 col-xxl-5 d-none d-xl-block m__pslider__swiper-slide-left">
<p class="f__poster m__pslider__swiper-slide-title u__c-green |">日本</p>
<div class="m__pslider__swiper-slide-divider"></div>

<p class="f__paragraph-large m__pslider__swiper-slide-large-text u__c-brown">東京都中央區銀座 5-8-15，12樓<br />
+81 3-6274-6171</p>
</div>
<div class="col-1 d-none d-xxl-block"></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="js__pslider__swiper-prev m__pslider__swiper-arrow m__pslider__swiper-prev"><img alt="Arrow pointing to the left" src="img/left-arrow-white.svg" /></div>

