</section>

<section class="m__cslider">
<div class="u__wrap">
<h1 class="f__section-header m__cslider__title u__c-gold">特色餐點</h1>

<div class="m__cslider__swiper swiper">
<div class="swiper-wrapper">
<div class="m__cslider__swiper-slide swiper-slide">
<div class="m__cslider__swiper-slide-content">
<div class="m__cslider__swiper-slide-highlight u__img-cover"><img src="img/feature01.jpg" /></div>

<p class="f__headline-h2 m__cslider__swiper-slide-title u__c-green">乾式熟成美國和牛戰斧牛排</p>
<div class="m__cslider__swiper-slide-divider"></div>

<p class="f__paragraph-regular m__cslider__swiper-slide-copy u__c-brown">44OZ.重量級和牛戰斧懸吊登場！以火槍炙燒乾式熟成牛油，香氣逼人的牛油為烤至焦酥的牛排增添風味！</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="m__cslider__swiper-slide swiper-slide">
<div class="m__cslider__swiper-slide-content">
<div class="m__cslider__swiper-slide-highlight u__img-cover"><img src="img/feature02.jpg" /></div>

<p class="f__headline-h2 m__cslider__swiper-slide-title u__c-green">乾式熟成帶骨戴爾莫尼科35OZ</p>
<div class="m__cslider__swiper-slide-divider"></div>

<p class="f__paragraph-regular m__cslider__swiper-slide-copy u__c-brown">戴爾莫尼科牛排保留了肋眼的迷人脂香，也帶有紐約客的奔放肉香，外層包裹上特製牛肝菌香料，高溫爐烤至外焦內嫩，上桌前淋上紅酒牛肉醬汁。</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="m__cslider__swiper-slide swiper-slide">
<div class="m__cslider__swiper-slide-content">
<div class="m__cslider__swiper-slide-highlight u__img-cover"><img src="img/feature03.jpg" /></div>

<p class="f__headline-h2 m__cslider__swiper-slide-title u__c-green">巨大巧克力蛋糕</p>
<div class="m__cslider__swiper-slide-divider"></div>

<p class="f__paragraph-regular m__cslider__swiper-slide-copy u__c-brown">5層貝禮詩奶酒注入巧克力蛋糕，再層疊上5層牛奶巧克力慕斯，最上方塗上一層濃郁的黑巧克力甘納許裝飾著可愛的小牛餅乾，是餐廳超人氣甜點。</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="m__cslider__swiper-slide swiper-slide">
<div class="m__cslider__swiper-slide-content">
